# CHANGES.log

## 2026-05-25 - Pronunciacion transversal
- Removed the dedicated Pronunciacion navigation mode and moved TTS speed plus chuleta controls into the global header.
- Added reusable speakable text for expressions so full phrases and individual words can be played from Biblioteca and Repaso.
- Added contextual pronunciation hints under active phrases/words when the chuleta toggle is enabled.
- Branch: main
- Status: Build, lint, and browser verification passing.

## 2026-05-25 - Estado real de IA y Google
- Fixed Ollama detection to use the local `/api/tags` endpoint and pick an installed model when the default is unavailable.
- Tightened DeepSeek API key detection and updated Settings copy so IA shows real connected states.
- Disabled Google Sheets sync unless explicitly enabled, leaving the UI as local backup active while cloud sync is pending implementation.
- Branch: main
- Status: Build, lint, and browser Settings verification passing.

## 2026-05-25 - Mapa personal del perfil linguistico
- Added a dedicated Mapa view that exposes the conversation analysis behind the vocabulary structure.
- Structured Enrike's communication profile, priority language functions, themes, literal translation traps, registers, and practice design in `src/data/personalMap.ts`.
- Split the audio settings hook out of the provider file so ESLint Fast Refresh rules pass.
- Branch: main
- Status: Build, lint, and local dev server smoke check passing.

